  "notes": "Near-monochrome warm-grey UI (Notion/Linear-like): black is the only strong accent (primary buttons, on-switches); green #2f6f4e used only for article counts (3 篇), red #d14b4b only for the account notification badge. Sources use small square monogram chips (first letter/CJK char) instead of favicons, followed by bold name plus tiny type tag (文章/资讯/播客). Disabled sources show grey switches with 已禁用. The 弹窗管理源 button opens a modal duplicating the tiles and toggle list. Pressing Escape on the live page navigated back to the reader home (three-pane reader with tabs 最新/热门/未读)."
